YamAN1x licensing status

A public release license for project-specific YamAN1x code has not yet been
selected. This development repository does not grant a project-wide
open-source license.

This statement does not replace or restrict the licenses of third-party code.
VOP3, AsmJit and the MAME source excerpts retain their original license terms
and copyright notices. See THIRD_PARTY.md and the accompanying license texts.

No Yamaha firmware, ROM, program-image or patch-bank payload is included.
